flowchart LR
 R["RESEARCH<br/>Sourced facts<br/>and hook hypotheses"] --> P["PLAN<br/>Rank approaches<br/>and explain choices"]
 P --> W["WRITE<br/>Use facts, history<br/>and session lessons"]
 W --> Q{"QUALITY GATE<br/>Rules, format<br/>and consistency"}
 Q -->|pass| T["SIMULATOR API<br/>Keyed requests<br/>and touch budget"]
 T --> E["EVALUATE<br/>Read the reaction<br/>Choose the next move"]
 Q -.->|correct| W
 E -.->|next decision + lesson| P
